OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over water quality at
OL,4,Asports centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FFresh concerns have been raised about
OL,7,Fthe water quality at the National Water
OL,8,FSports Centre in Nottinghamshire.
OL,10,FKayaker Eoin Matthews said he fell
OL,11,F"very ill" 36 hours after falling into
OL,12,Fthe white water facility and swallowing
OL,13,Fwater.
OL,15,FHe contacted James Naish, his local MP,
OL,16,Fwho raised the issue in a debate in
OL,17,Fparliament on public ownership of water
OL,18,Fcompanies last month.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
