OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over water quality at
OL,4,Asports centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeisure Solutions Community Trust,
OL,7,Fwhich operates the site alongside Serco
OL,8,Ffor Nottinghamshire County Council,
OL,9,Fsaid it had "limited ability to
OL,10,Fdirectly influence the quality of
OL,11,Fincoming river water" while Severn
OL,12,FTrent said water conditions were
OL,13,F"influenced by many factors".
